{"title": "Supreme Tadpole", "pageid": 57487, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Supreme_Tadpole", "categories": ["Misc items", "Story items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-story\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Supreme_Tadpole_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/df/Supreme_Tadpole_Faded.png/300px-Supreme_Tadpole_Faded.png.webp, /w/images/d/df/Supreme_Tadpole_Faded.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Supreme Tadpole image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/df/Supreme_Tadpole_Faded.png/300px-Supreme_Tadpole_Faded.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/df/Supreme_Tadpole_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p>The <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\"><span style=\"color: #FF5901 ;\">Supreme Tadpole</span></a> is capable of turning a party member or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Orpheus\" title=\"Orpheus\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e0/Portrait_Orpheus.png/25px-Portrait_Orpheus.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e0/Portrait_Orpheus.png/38px-Portrait_Orpheus.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e0/Portrait_Orpheus.png/50px-Portrait_Orpheus.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Orpheus\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e0/Portrait_Orpheus.png/25px-Portrait_Orpheus.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e0/Portrait_Orpheus.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Orpheus\" title=\"Orpheus\">Orpheus</a> into a <a href=\"/wiki/Full-illithid\" title=\"Full-illithid\">full-illithid</a> character.\n\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>So much power, a gateway to become a Mind Flayer.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Miscellaneous\" title=\"Miscellaneous\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Miscellaneous Items\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Miscellaneous\" title=\"Miscellaneous\">Miscellaneous Items</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Story Item\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: <span style=\"color: #FF5901 ;\">Story Item</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 0.2 kg (0.4 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 0.2 kg (0.4 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 1 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  1  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-28a730d896f71134END_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-79454ff402e3323eEND_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">LOOT_MF_Tadpole_Supreme_A</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:LOOT_MF_Tadpole_Supreme_A\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:LOOT_MF_Tadpole_Supreme_A\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">a313a568-9b27-4b94-8ad8-50fcc374179f</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:a313a568-9b27-4b94-8ad8-50fcc374179f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:a313a568-9b27-4b94-8ad8-50fcc374179f\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>  \n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Effect\"> Effect </span></h3>\n<p>User transforms into a <a href=\"/wiki/Full-illithid\" title=\"Full-illithid\">full-illithid</a> character, i.e., a <a href=\"/wiki/Mind_flayer\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mind flayer\">mind flayer</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Given by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Emperor\" title=\"The Emperor\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c6/Portrait_The_Emperor.png/25px-Portrait_The_Emperor.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c6/Portrait_The_Emperor.png/38px-Portrait_The_Emperor.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c6/Portrait_The_Emperor.png/50px-Portrait_The_Emperor.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"The Emperor\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c6/Portrait_The_Emperor.png/25px-Portrait_The_Emperor.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c6/Portrait_The_Emperor.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/The_Emperor\" title=\"The Emperor\">The Emperor</a> near the end of <a href=\"/wiki/Act_Three\" title=\"Act Three\">Act Three</a></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Usage\"> Usage </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Consumed by a party member or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Orpheus\" title=\"Orpheus\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e0/Portrait_Orpheus.png/25px-Portrait_Orpheus.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e0/Portrait_Orpheus.png/38px-Portrait_Orpheus.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e0/Portrait_Orpheus.png/50px-Portrait_Orpheus.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Orpheus\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e0/Portrait_Orpheus.png/25px-Portrait_Orpheus.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e0/Portrait_Orpheus.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Orpheus\" title=\"Orpheus\">Orpheus</a> to become <a href=\"/wiki/Full-illithid\" title=\"Full-illithid\">full-illithid</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>     \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202004\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.055 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.057 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2065/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 27930/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6897/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 27/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 936022/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   45.929      1 Template:Misc_item_page\n100.00%   45.929      1 -total\n 59.30%   27.236      8 Template:Icon_text\n 53.66%   24.647     20 Template:Trim\n 36.90%   16.946      1 Template:PageSeo\n 36.72%   16.866      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 29.36%   13.483      3 Template:CharLink\n 27.57%   12.661      4 Template:Icon_link\n 20.47%    9.403      8 Template:Ifempty\n 20.29%    9.320      2 Template:Uid\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:57487-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714202004 and revision id 378151. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}